I was able to reduce this to the following (which currently fails)

``` php
        $table = TableRegistry::get('Comments');
        $query = $table->find()
            ->formatResults(function ($results) {
                return $results;
            });
        $res = $query->all();
        $res->isEmpty();
        $this->assertCount(6, $res->toArray());
```

If the `formatResults()` or `isEmpty()` call is removed the test passes. I've not had a chance to dig deeper just yet, but it seems like interaction of the various stacked iterators is causing issues.

